cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Counting Penguins: pipeline code"
version: "1.0"
abstract: >-
  Code for an automated pipeline that estimates the size of Adélie penguin
  breeding colonies from uncrewed aerial vehicle (UAV) imagery, as applied to
  Cape Crozier, Cape Bird, and Cape Royds, Ross Island, Antarctica, in
  2018-2025, with scripts reproducing the analyses, tables, and figures of the
  accompanying paper.
keywords:
  - Adélie penguin
  - UAV
  - deep learning
  - YOLOv8
  - population census
  - Antarctica
repository-code: "https://github.com/pointblue/counting_penguins"
url: "https://github.com/pointblue/counting_penguins"
license: MIT
